<title>POLAND: KRUSZWICA JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 83,500.</title>
<headline>KRUSZWICA JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 83,500.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.08 vs   1.66</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.54 vs   4.14</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.42 vs   6.89</p>
<p> Sales		   47.08 vs  54.32</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish edible fats maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Tluszczowe Kruszwica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
